<title>UK: Orange, Natwest launch credit card.</title>
<headline>Orange, Natwest launch credit card.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>British mobile phone service Orange Plc and National Westminster Bank Plc said on Saturday they were launching an Orange Visa credit card.</p>
<p>The card will double as a global calling card offering Orange customers the ability to make calls from over 200 countries. The credit card will charge APR of 17.2 percent and up to 56 days interest free credit.</p>
<p>Orange's national digital wirefree phone service has some 659,000 subscribers and is available to about 90 percent of Britain's population.</p>
</text>
